  "interpretation": [
    "The sole official annotation establishes runner/server communication loss. Its text lists possible workflow termination, CPU/memory starvation, or network blockage. It does not identify which cause occurred and does not establish pure platform exoneration.",
    "The completed failure job retains step 7 in_progress and upload pending. Do not infer native exit code, completion, zero operations, elapsed native measurement time, deadline compliance, or result from those API step fields.",
    "The complete artifact snapshot contains four smaller-scale repetition-0 shard names, five capacity archives, one build archive, and the failed matrix. No 100000 repetition-0 shard is present. The four shard payloads were not revalidated in this readback.",
    "The original matrix is failed with 146 missing cells. Its sample_count field is absent, not an observed count of zero.",
    "Collector success means original data were received and identity-checked; it never changes the original failure or supplies release certification.",
    "A23 evidence remains source-bound to A23, independently of main60's later snapshot-batching integration."
  ],
